mains the actual trained nn.Module and view.item_emb its collaborative embedding. Preserve user_train, meta_data, and review_data without fabricating unavailable fields. Have log2feats expose collaborative features plus causal context through an explicitly documented packed representation, such as float64 collaborative features followed by the ordered last-20 context IDs, verifying exact integer representation and casting collaborative features back to their scoring dtype inside predict_score. Recompute the identical deduplication, ages, pooling, and gate there. Define separate handling for position-aligned IDs, shared candidate vectors, and per-position candidate matrices; avoid ambiguous broadcasting. Keep embedding-only probes separate from packed features. If another representation is required by the existing adapter, document and update its consumer consistently. Probes must use eval/no_grad, restore prior model mode, and score the deployed residual. Retain finite-score checks, margins, and pair-error rates, with unavailable item-category breakdowns explicitly marked. Embedding cosine remains descriptive rather than proof of collapse or diversity. Add precisely defined support/gate activation, removed squared profile norm, distinct supporting IDs, duplicate concentration, residual RMS, alpha boundary frequency, residual-to-collaborative scale, and candidate rank-change summaries.\n\nExport and parity: update the predictor writer, not only a generated file. Serialize category weights, architecture configuration, mappings, routes, tokenizer settings, vocabulary, document frequencies, IDF, sparse catalog rows, token eligibility, pooling settings, alpha and cap, padding, and truncation. Verify scorer and generated working/predict.py parity on deterministic training-visible fixtures covering empty histories, missing text, repeated IDs, one distinct item, two-item support, ubiquitous words, zero eligible vocabulary, near-identical titles, and mixed-category routes. V