it excludes training-seed and candidate variability and does not correct adaptive selection bias. Fixed-seed reruns assess reproducibility, not seed robustness. Treat selected gains as exploratory, freeze the configuration before the independent host test, and never access hidden test labels. Sampled HR@10 does not establish full-catalog superiority; simulator recommendations assess a different setting.\n\nUser-facing limitations: track broad-match, stale-interest, uncertain-content, unsupported-task, duplicated-capability, and useful-complement judgments only when the simulator actually supplies them. Do not invent compatibility, ownership, unmet needs, quantities, or diversity/conformity traits. The gate can suppress synonyms, newly emerging interests, sparse histories, and useful complements while still rewarding product variants. Event-age decay does not model elapsed-time seasonality. The supplied 0.5587 and 0.5538 scores are historical observations, not new measurements, compatible-run guarantees, uncertainty estimates, or evidence identifying a mechanism. Learned text encoders and directed transitions remain follow-ups; recurrence-filtered TF–IDF is the appropriate low-complexity next experiment only if the matched controls remain affordable.",
  "pseudocode": "CONFIG: preserve four baseline routes; preprocessing_seed=0; training_seed=42\nDATA_DIR = os.environ['GAGC_DATA_DIR']\nCONFIG: window=20; event_half_life=5; confidence_shrinkage=1\nCONFIG: negatives=32; temperature=1; primary_alpha_cap=1\nCONFIG: effective_epochs=int(os.environ.get('SASREC_EPOCHS', '200'))\n\n# Freeze trial list, checkpoint schedule, query rules, and budget before results.\nremaining = 43200 - all_previously_charged_GPU_seconds\nreserve = remaining / 6\nadmit_only_complete_comparisons_that_fit(remaining - reserve)\n\nfor category in baseline_categories:\n    X, vocabulary, df, N = load_compatible_artifacts_or_fit_declared_training_only_TFIDF()\n    eligible = (df >= 2) & (df <= floor(0.05*N))\n\n    for condition in ['objective_only', 'unmasked', 'gated']:\n        initialize_identical_SASRec(seed=42)\n        negative_rng = dedicated_generator(seed=42)\n        alpha = trainable_scalar(0.0)\n\n        for batch in unchanged_training_loader:\n            h = causal_SASRec_features(batch.sequence)\n            losses = []\n            for valid position t:\n                prefix = batch.sequence through t\n                candidates, candidate_mask = positive_plus_uniform_negatives(\n                    target=batch.positive[t], count=32, replacement=False,\n                    exclude=padding_and_target_and_prefix_ids, rng=negative_rng)\n                if no_eligible_negative: continue\n                logits = dot(h[t], item_emb(candidates))\n\n                if condition != 'objective_only':\n                    events = last_20_nonpadding_events(prefix)\n                    ids, ages = latest_occurrence_dedup_with_original_event_ages(events)\n                    V = X[ids]\n                    agreement[j] = mean_nonnegative_cosine_to_other_distinct_rows(V,j)\n                    # Empty comparison sets return zero.\n                    w = 2**(-ages/5) * agreement\n                    p = normalize_or_zero(sparse_weighted_sum(V,w))\n                    c = sum(w)/(sum(w)+1) if norm(p)>0 else 0\n                    if condition == 'gated':\n                        count = count_nonzero_rows_per_token(V)\n                        z = p * (eligible & (count >= 2))\n                    else:\n                        z = p\n                    # Never renormalize z; never use target to construct p or z.\n                    logits += alpha*c*sparse_dot(z, X[candidates])\n\n                losses.append(masked_CE(logits, positive_index=0, temperature=1))\n            if losses:\n                optimize(mean(losses))\n                project_alpha_to_interval(0, declared_cap)\n            honor_predeclared_checkpoint_schedule_exposure_and_budget()\n\n        export_trial_local_artifacts_and_matching_predictor_writer()\n        verify_causal_score_order_shape_and_routing_parity()\n        run_adapted_DiagnosisProbe_on_actual_model_with_deployed_scores()\n\n# Optional matched cap family: A in {0,1,2}, equally available to both residuals.\n# Every trained configuration and validation query is charged and recorded.\n# Frozen diagnostic interventions: centroids, last-item, recurrence/corpus-filter ablations,\n# frequency-matched random masks, centered-RMS matching, text-source/identifier masks,\n# and duplicate-overlap strata. These are not retrained competitors.\n# Bootstrap only authorized existing paired user outcomes; disclose selection bias.\n# Select complete configurations by pinned macro validation HR@10; incumbent wins ties.\n# Freeze selection before host test; never inspect hidden test labels.",
